WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.700
The investigation list contains four owned incidents, including one with insufficient evidence.

2
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:09.200
An investigation finds that an overlay intercepts a checkout click. The hypothesis links to retained logs, DOM evidence, and a source diff.

3
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:13.800
The evidence view opens the source log that records intercepted pointer events.

4
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:18.300
The experiment compares three failing baseline runs with three passing intervention runs after removing the overlay.

5
00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:23.000
The reviewer records that support is limited to this owned fixture, then saves the note.

6
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.560
A separate incident lacks diagnostic artifacts. Its result remains inconclusive and no experiment is reported.
